 welcome back. Most of us spend hours every week in meetings, and a lot of that time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues with all settings optimized.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1709.950082999996,"totalMs":1709.9622499999969,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues with all settings optimized.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1866.7045829999988,"totalMs":1866.717082999996,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues with all settings optimized.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1702.942750000002,"totalMs":1702.9587089999986,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues with all settings optimized.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1792.994875000004,"totalMs":1793.0033330000006,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording